Erik snatched it from Christine, she yelped in pain. Raoul exploded with rage when he heard her cry

5
00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:34.144
out. "No!" he shouted. "What was that?" Erik demanded. "I didn't hear anything," Christine said. "Well, I thought I

