heard a cry." "Erik, you and I are the only people here," Christine said, "and I cried out

7
00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:51.297
because you hurt my wrist when you took away the bag." "I don't like the way you said

8
00:00:51.298 --> 00:00:59.222
that. Furthermore, you're trembling, and I suspect that's because you're lying to me. I'm certain I heard a cry—there

9
00:01:00.573 --> 00:01:08.112
must be someone next door. Perhaps it's the man you want to marry." "Oh, Erik," Christine said, forcing

