22
00:02:44.921 --> 00:02:49.544
The Persian shrugged to indicate that he had no idea either. The two men soon heard Christine's voice above

23
00:02:49.545 --> 00:02:57.533
their heads. "No one's there, dear," she called down to Erik. "Are you quite sure?" "Yes, I can't

24
00:02:58.781 --> 00:03:04.198
see anybody." "All right, you can come back down," Erik said. Raoul and the Persian let out quiet

25
