trying to distract her from something." Christine had sensed that something bad was connected to the light. "Erik,

37
00:04:50.474 --> 00:05:00.428
is there really any need for that bright light in the hexagon room? I've already looked and seen nothing

38
00:05:00.429 --> 00:05:06.614
there, so maybe you could turn it out." "Not now, my dear. Let me demonstrate my skills as

39
00:05:06.615 --> 00:05:14.214
a ventriloquist. I'll raise my mask just a little, so you can see that my mouth—such as it

40
