is—never moves. And yet you can hear my voice. Where should my voice come from . . . the

41
00:05:22.029 --> 00:05:34.269
leather bag? How about the little box on the right on your mantelpiece? Or the little box on

42
00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:41.266
the left? One of those ebony boxes is quite safe, but the other—" "I'm still wondering about that

43
00:05:41.267 --> 00:05:48.733
light," Christine interrupted him. "Don't you think you could put it out?" "Not now, dear," Erik said. "Don't you

44
00:05:50.381 --> 00:06:02.876
want to hear how I made Carlotta croak when she sang? One minute my voice was coming from

45
00:06:02.877 --> 00:06:16.685
her throat, and the next it was on a chair in box five, telling the managers, 'Carlotta is singing

