to bring down the chandelier!' And where is my voice now, darling Christine? It's in the hexagon room saying, 'Woe to him who has a real nose and has come to snoop around Erik's house!'" Raoul

47
00:06:27.059 --> 00:06:37.028
looked at the Persian in terror. "Erik knows we're in here!" he said. "He was only pretending to be

48
00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:43.284
satisfied when Christine said no one was here." Suddenly Erik's terrible voice was everywhere. It passed through the

49
00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:54.106
wall and surrounded his captives, who felt that he was in the room with them. Raoul and the

50
00:06:54.107 --> 00:06:59.324
Persian put their hands over their ears, but they couldn't block out that horrible sound. Just when they thought

51
00:06:59.325 --> 00:07:06.293
they couldn't bear it for another second, Christine said, "Erik, I'm tired of listening to your voice, and

52
